  "description": "A self-contained INI library for .NET 8 and .NET 10, shaped after System.Text.Json and matching the sibling Bodu.Text.Toml surface: the forward-only ref-struct Utf8IniReader/Utf8IniWriter token surface over UTF-8, a mutable IniNode DOM, a read-only IniDocument DOM, and the IniSerializer POCO mapper. INI models a two-level object-of-objects (sections then string keys).",
